# Job Manifest

Copy this template to `jobs/{date}_{slug}/manifest.json` and fill every field before review.

```json
{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "job_id": "YYYY-MM-DD-slug",
  "content_mode": "ugc_ad|motivational|faceless|product_demo|ai_avatar|music_led|cinematic",
  "status": "draft|needs_review|approved|blocked|published",
  "target_platforms": ["tiktok", "instagram_reels", "youtube_shorts"],
  "duration_seconds": 30,
  "source_assets": [],
  "rights_status": "needs_review",
  "ai_disclosure_required": "needs_review",
  "prompt_versions": [],
  "claims_requiring_review": [],
  "reviewer": null,
  "approved_at": null,
  "publish_urls": []
}
```

Never place passwords, API keys, access tokens, or private personal data in this file.
